# $proxy requires exactly 1 argument; calling with 2 args is an arity error
[proxy [fn [let field] hello] [fn [let field] world]]
=== error
[E020] arity mismatch: expected 1 argument, got 2 (defined at 1:1-1:54)
  in [proxy ...] at 1:1-1:54
  in [proxy ...] at 1:1-1:54

=== warn
arity mismatch: expected 1 argument(s), got 2 (2 positional, 0 named) at 1:1-1:54
